# CSVs are hand-maintained input in this repo — the manual collector's
# examples, which a new setup copies to seed its own files. CRLF in one
# of them propagates to every copy, and the next tool that rewrites the
# file churns every line instead of the one that changed.
#
# Source CSVs captured from a provider are bronze and live outside the
# repo, so nothing here rewrites what a bank actually sent.
*.csv text eol=lf
